# Twinblade Paladin: "As long as you have 25 or more life, this creature has double strike." On turn 3 Bot1 sacrifices two lands to
# Zuran Orb (+2 each, two gains, two counters): at 24 life the Paladin has no double strike. Fountain of Youth gives the 1 that
# makes exactly 25: now it has double strike and is a 6/6 (three counters), so its attack deals 12 to Bot2 in two combat damage
# steps (CR 702.4, 510.4). On turn 4 Bot2's Lightning Bolt takes Bot1 to 22 and the Paladin loses it again (CR 613.1f).

